source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Monitor sync jobs

Usage: vendo jobs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List sync jobs
  get     Get job details
  cancel  Cancel a pending or running job
  watch   Watch running and pending jobs (live polling)
  tail    Tail a single job or the latest job for a source/destination

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
